  31:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (#) Scan mode for automatic conversion of channel 0 to channel x.
  32:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (#) Data alignment with in-built data coherency.
  33:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (#) Channel-wise programmable sampling time.
  34:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (#) External trigger option with configurable polarity for both regular and
  35:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****       injected conversion.
  36:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (#) Dual/Triple mode (on devices with 2 ADCs or more).
  37:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (#) Configurable DMA data storage in Dual/Triple ADC mode.
  38:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (#) Configurable delay between conversions in Dual/Triple interleaved mode.
  39:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (#) ADC conversion type (refer to the datasheets).
  40:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (#) ADC supply requirements: 2.4 V to 3.6 V at full speed and down to 1.8 V at
