  42:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (#) ADC input range: VREF(minus) = VIN = VREF(plus).
  43:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (#) DMA request generation during regular channel conversion.
