  50:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (##) Enable the ADC interface clock using __HAL_RCC_ADC_CLK_ENABLE()
  51:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (##) ADC pins configuration
  52:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****              (+++) Enable the clock for the ADC GPIOs using the following function:
  53:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****                    __HAL_RCC_GPIOx_CLK_ENABLE()
  54:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****              (+++) Configure these ADC pins in analog mode using HAL_GPIO_Init()
  55:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (##) In case of using interrupts (e.g. HAL_ADC_Start_IT())
  56:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****              (+++) Configure the ADC interrupt priority using HAL_NVIC_SetPriority()
  57:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****              (+++) Enable the ADC IRQ handler using HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ()
  58:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****              (+++) In ADC IRQ handler, call HAL_ADC_IRQHandler()
  59:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (##) In case of using DMA to control data transfer (e.g. HAL_ADC_Start_DMA())
  60:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****              (+++) Enable the DMAx interface clock using __HAL_RCC_DMAx_CLK_ENABLE()
  61:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****              (+++) Configure and enable two DMA streams stream for managing data
  62:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****                  transfer from peripheral to memory (output stream)
  63:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****              (+++) Associate the initialized DMA handle to the CRYP DMA handle
  64:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****                  using  __HAL_LINKDMA()
  65:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****              (+++) Configure the priority and enable the NVIC for the transfer complete
  66:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****                  interrupt on the two DMA Streams. The output stream should have higher
  67:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****                  priority than the input stream.
