  72:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (#) Configure the ADC parameters (resolution, data alignment, ...)
  73:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****       and regular group parameters (conversion trigger, sequencer, ...)
  74:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****       using function HAL_ADC_Init().
  75:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
