  84:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****       using function HAL_ADCEx_InjectedConfigChannel().
  85:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  86:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (#) Optionally, configure the analog watchdog parameters (channels
  87:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****       monitored, thresholds, ...) using function HAL_ADC_AnalogWDGConfig().
