 163:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      (++) Disable the clock for the ADC GPIOs using macro __HAL_RCC_GPIOx_CLK_DISABLE()
 164:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
