 167:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 168:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (#) Optionally, in case of usage of DMA:
 169:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****         (++) Deinitialize the DMA using function HAL_DMA_DeInit().
 170:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****         (++) Disable the NVIC for DMA using function HAL_NVIC_DisableIRQ(DMAx_Channelx_IRQn)
 171:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****                       *** Callback registration ***
 172:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   ==============================================================================
 173:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 174:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 175:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      The compilation flag USE_HAL_ADC_REGISTER_CALLBACKS, when set to 1,
 176:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
 177:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Use Functions HAL_ADC_RegisterCallback()
 178:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      to register an interrupt callback.
 179:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 180:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 181:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Function HAL_ADC_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
 182:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ConvCpltCallback               : ADC conversion complete callback
 183:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ConvHalfCpltCallback           : ADC conversion DMA half-transfer callback
 184:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) LevelOutOfWindowCallback       : ADC analog watchdog 1 callback
 185:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ErrorCallback                  : ADC error callback
 186:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) InjectedConvCpltCallback       : ADC group injected conversion complete callback
 187:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) InjectedQueueOverflowCallback  : ADC group injected context queue overflow callback
 188:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) LevelOutOfWindow2Callback      : ADC analog watchdog 2 callback
 189:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) LevelOutOfWindow3Callback      : ADC analog watchdog 3 callback
 190:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) EndOfSamplingCallback          : ADC end of sampling callback
 191:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) MspInitCallback                : ADC Msp Init callback
 192:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) MspDeInitCallback              : ADC Msp DeInit callback
 193:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
 194:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      and a pointer to the user callback function.
 195:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 196:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 197:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Use function HAL_ADC_UnRegisterCallback to reset a callback to the default
 198:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      weak function.
 199:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 200:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 201:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      HAL_ADC_UnRegisterCallback takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
ARM GAS  C:\Users\honor\AppData\Local\Temp\ccHzvzWc.s 			page 5


 202:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      and the Callback ID.
 203:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      This function allows to reset following callbacks:
 204:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ConvCpltCallback               : ADC conversion complete callback
 205:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ConvHalfCpltCallback           : ADC conversion DMA half-transfer callback
 206:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) LevelOutOfWindowCallback       : ADC analog watchdog 1 callback
 207:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ErrorCallback                  : ADC error callback
 208:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) InjectedConvCpltCallback       : ADC group injected conversion complete callback
 209:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) InjectedQueueOverflowCallback  : ADC group injected context queue overflow callback
 210:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) LevelOutOfWindow2Callback      : ADC analog watchdog 2 callback
 211:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) LevelOutOfWindow3Callback      : ADC analog watchdog 3 callback
 212:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) EndOfSamplingCallback          : ADC end of sampling callback
 213:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) MspInitCallback                : ADC Msp Init callback
 214:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) MspDeInitCallback              : ADC Msp DeInit callback
 215:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      [..]
 216:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 217:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      By default, after the HAL_ADC_Init() and when the state is HAL_ADC_STATE_RESET
 218:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      all callbacks are set to the corresponding weak functions:
 219:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      examples HAL_ADC_ConvCpltCallback(), HAL_ADC_ErrorCallback().
 220:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Exception done for MspInit and MspDeInit functions that are
 221:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      reset to the legacy weak functions in the HAL_ADC_Init()/ HAL_ADC_DeInit() only when
 222:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      these callbacks are null (not registered beforehand).
 223:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 224:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 225:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      If MspInit or MspDeInit are not null, the HAL_ADC_Init()/ HAL_ADC_DeInit()
 226:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      keep and use the user MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks (registered beforehand) whatever the state.
 227:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      [..]
 228:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 229:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Callbacks can be registered/unregistered in HAL_ADC_STATE_READY state only.
 230:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Exception done MspInit/MspDeInit functions that can be registered/unregistered
 231:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      in HAL_ADC_STATE_READY or HAL_ADC_STATE_RESET state,
 232:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      thus registered (user) MspInit/DeInit callbacks can be used during the Init/DeInit.
 233:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 234:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 235:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Then, the user first registers the MspInit/MspDeInit user callbacks
 236:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      using HAL_ADC_RegisterCallback() before calling HAL_ADC_DeInit()
 237:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      or HAL_ADC_Init() function.
 238:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      [..]
 239:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 240:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      When the compilation flag USE_HAL_ADC_REGISTER_CALLBACKS is set to 0 or
 241:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      not defined, the callback registration feature is not available and all callbacks
 242:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****      are set to the corresponding weak functions.
 243:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 244:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****     @endverbatim
 245:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   */
 246:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
