 296:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c **** /**
 297:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @brief  Initializes the ADCx peripheral according to the specified parameters
 298:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         in the ADC_InitStruct and initializes the ADC MSP.
 299:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *
 300:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note   This function is used to configure the global features of the ADC (
 301:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         ClockPrescaler, Resolution, Data Alignment and number of conversion), however,
 302:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         the rest of the configuration parameters are specific to the regular
 303:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         channels group (scan mode activation, continuous mode activation,
 304:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         External trigger source and edge, DMA continuous request after the
 305:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         last transfer and End of conversion selection).
 306:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *
 307:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @param  hadc pointer to a ADC_HandleTypeDef structure that contains
 308:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         the configuration information for the specified ADC.
 309:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @retval HAL status
 310:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   */
 311:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c **** HAL_StatusTypeDef HAL_ADC_Init(ADC_HandleTypeDef *hadc)
