1780:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * In this case, some constraints must be taken into account:
1781:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * The programmed threshold values are effective from the next
1782:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * ADC EOC (end of unitary conversion).
